416
00:22:21.393 --> 00:22:22.417
Interview time:

417
00:22:22.697 --> 00:22:23.892
3 to 5 min.

418
00:22:24.172 --> 00:22:25.132
Key output:

419
00:22:25.412 --> 00:22:28.100
Peak QPS, storage per year, read:write.

420
00:22:28.380 --> 00:22:29.447
Common mistake:

421
00:22:29.727 --> 00:22:32.116
Precision theatre; skipping it entirely.

422
00:22:32.396 --> 00:22:33.121
3.

423
00:22:33.401 --> 00:22:34.361
API.

424
