Endpoints or events with key fields.

428
00:22:41.137 --> 00:22:42.204
Common mistake:

429
00:22:42.484 --> 00:22:44.084
Designing 20 endpoints.

430
00:22:44.364 --> 00:22:45.068
4.

431
00:22:45.348 --> 00:22:46.329
Data model.

432
00:22:46.609 --> 00:22:47.633
Interview time:

433
00:22:47.913 --> 00:22:48.809
5 min.

434
00:22:49.089 --> 00:22:50.049
Key output:

435
00:22:50.329 --> 00:22:52.612
Entities, access patterns, store choice.

436
00:22:52.892 --> 00:22:53.959
Common mistake:

437
00:22:54.239 --> 00:22:55.839
Choosing DB by fashion.

438
00:22:56.119 --> 00:22:56.887
5.

439
00:22:57.167 --> 00:22:58.148
