443
00:23:02.105 --> 00:23:04.601
Diagram of the simplest working design.

444
00:23:04.881 --> 00:23:05.948
Common mistake:

445
00:23:06.228 --> 00:23:08.660
Starting with Kafka + 12 services.

446
00:23:10.010 --> 00:23:10.757
6.

447
00:23:11.037 --> 00:23:12.061
Deep dives.

448
