461
00:23:32.557 --> 00:23:34.349
Ignoring failure until asked.

462
00:23:34.629 --> 00:23:35.311
8.

463
00:23:35.591 --> 00:23:36.423
Wrap-up.

464
00:23:36.703 --> 00:23:37.727
